{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%81%9C%E8%BB%8A%E6%A8%99%E8%AA%8C%E5%89%8D%E6%B2%92%E5%81%9C%E4%B8%8B%E8%87%B4%E6%92%9E%E8%BB%8A-%E4%BC%91%E7%8F%AD%E8%AD%A6%E8%AA%8D%E5%8D%B1%E9%A7%95-%E7%BD%B0%E6%AC%BE8000%E5%85%83%E5%8F%8A%E5%81%9C%E7%89%8C15%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88-%E9%86%AB%E7%94%9F%E6%8C%87%E7%84%A1%E6%B3%95%E8%AD%89%E6%98%8E%E8%BB%8A%E7%A6%8D%E5%A5%B3%E4%B9%98%E5%AE%A2%E8%BA%AB%E4%BA%A1%E8%88%87%E6%A1%88%E6%9C%89%E9%97%9C-861x1024.jpg\" width=\"861\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>去年聖誕節晚上，兩私家車在跑馬地摩理臣山道相撞，車上一名七旬女乘客其後報稱不適自行求醫，一周後證實不治，駕駛另一私家車的31歲休班警起初被控一項「危險駕駛引致他人死亡」罪，控方之後修訂控罪為「危險駕駛」罪，涉案男警今（25日）於東區裁判法院認罪，控方指醫生無法證明事主離世與本案事故有因果關係。涉案男警終被罰款8000元及停牌15個月。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告葉嘉豪（31歲）原被控一項「危險駕駛引致他人死亡」罪，控方今年8月修訂控罪為「危險駕駛」，控罪指稱，被告於2025年12月25日，在跑馬地摩理臣山道（東行）與摩理臣山道（南行）交界，在道路上危險駕駛一輛私家車。</p>\n<p>被告今認罪。案情指，被告當日休班，駕駛私家車駛至案發路段時，沒有在「停車」標誌前停下，導致其車輛撞上另一架私家車。</p>\n<p>法院：東區裁判法院<br/>法官：裁判官朱文瀚<br/>被告：葉嘉豪<br/>控罪：危險駕駛<br/>案件編號：ESCC1486/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:03:59.606703+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":419,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:43:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T11:48:08.594497+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:57:15.769595+00:00","content_hash":"6b1ac311f4d5ab5337cd026a5977813af402da7ae8fb216d01093e8b1c6cdc8f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}